age/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Fire Lore II</a>:</b> Passive: Your Fire spells gain a 12% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tattered_Gloves.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Tattered_Gloves.png/420px-Tattered_Gloves.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tattered_Gloves.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This pair of singed leather gloves are tattered and worn through from use.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816182644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.131 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2880/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16776/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3451/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n118.59%  138.791     35 Template:IO\n100.00%  117.036      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  117.036      1 -total\n 95.24%  111.460      1 Template:Named